15. Common Mistakes
==================

❌ Forgetting template<>

Incorrect

class Printer<bool>

Correct

template<>
class Printer<bool>

--------------------------------------

❌ Trying to partially specialize function templates.

Not Allowed

--------------------------------------

❌ Assuming specialization happens at runtime.

It is selected entirely at compile time.

--------------------------------------

❌ Confusing specialization with inheritance.

Specialization customizes templates.

Inheritance extends classes.

